OL,4,BMadueke 'a consistent threat' -        
OL,5,BNewcastle v Arsenal player ratings     
OL,6,GArsenal and Newcastle played out an    
OL,7,Gentertaining 2-2 draw at St James'     
OL,8,GPark on Saturday.                      
OL,10,FThe Gunners took the lead through      
OL,11,FEberechi Eze in the first half before  
OL,12,FHarvey Barnes equalised after the      
OL,13,Fbreak.                                 
OL,15,FThe hosts went ahead when Malick Thiaw 
OL,16,Fbundled in from a corner before Noni   
OL,17,FMadueke brought the Gunners level with 
OL,18,Fan excellent strike, and that is how   
OL,19,Fit finished.                           
